id: pm-29bwud
title: Reserve preparation and runner queue time before serial release acceptance
description: "Observed October26 Auto Release40265600223 cancelled at its110-minute parent deadline at05:35:30Z; exact-tag Release40269172902 succeeded and advertised v2026.10.26 at05:35:55Z. Preparation alone consumed42minutes rather than the assumed30; downstream runner queues consumed additional wall time. The serial child60+15+5 minute job limits remain valid, but the parent has no realistic preparation and queue reserve. Preserve immutable publication and same-day guards; extend only the orchestration envelope and strengthen the existing workflow budget contract."
