actual_result: "The original assertion admits a native170minute workflow fixture; the strengthened assertion refuses it. Restored production180minutes passes135 focused tests,48 linked release tests, TypeScript/build and the complete static pipeline. Previously verified accepted-tag recovery and all nine public platform legs remain unchanged."
